       24112-DIAS-PRI-LIQ.
      *
           IF ADS-DIASCAL = CTE-CON-COMERCIALES OR CTE-CON-PERDIDA
               MOVE CTE-CON-3                 TO W075-CDOPCIO
               MOVE CTE-CON-CO                TO W075-TPTRAT
