      *
      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             24113-CALC-NUM-PERIODOS                          *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE CALCULA EL NUMERO DE PERIODOS DE AMORTIZACION EN CASO     *
      *   DE QUE EL PRESTAMO SEA DE TIPO 4.                            *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
       24113-CALC-NUM-PERIODOS.
      *
           MOVE CTE-CON-3                     TO W075-CDOPCIO.
           MOVE CTE-CON-CO                    TO W075-TPTRAT.
      *
           MOVE WS-FECHA-AMO-4                TO DFP-FECHA-INICIAL
           MOVE CTE-CON-31                    TO DFP-DIA
           MOVE TBLA-PLAZO                    TO DFP-PERCAP
           MOVE CTE-CON-1                     TO DFP-NUM-PERIODOS
           MOVE ADS-TIPODIAS                  TO DFP-TIPODIAS
           PERFORM  241112-LLAMAR-RUTINA
      *
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL               TO WS-FECHA-FINAL
           MOVE ZERO                          TO TFC-DIAS-A-CONTAR
      *
           MOVE WS-FECHA-AMO                  TO AUX-AAAA-MM-DD.
           MOVE AUX-AAAA                      TO WS-AUX-AAAA.
           MOVE AUX-MM                        TO WS-AUX-MM.
           MOVE AUX-DD                        TO WS-AUX-DD.
           MOVE WS-AUX-DD-MM-AAAA             TO W075-FHGRE1.
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL               TO AUX-AAAA-MM-DD.
           MOVE AUX-AAAA                      TO WS-AUX-AAAA.
           MOVE AUX-MM                        TO WS-AUX-MM.
           MOVE AUX-DD                        TO WS-AUX-DD.
           MOVE WS-AUX-DD-MM-AAAA             TO W075-FHGRE2.
      *
           EXEC CICS LINK
                PROGRAM ('TC1C1220')
                COMMAREA (TCWC0750-AREA)
           END-EXEC.
      *
           IF W075-CDRETORN NOT = CTE-CON-ALFA-00
              MOVE 'UGE0010'                  TO TBLA-CODERROR
              MOVE '30'                    TO TBLA-CODRETO
              MOVE 'TC1C1220'                 TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
              PERFORM 30000-FINAL
           END-IF.
