           MOVE W075-NUMDIAS                  TO TFC-DIAS-A-CONTAR
           MOVE WS-PERCAP                     TO WS-CODIGO-PERIODO
      *
           MULTIPLY WS-PERIODO BY WS-CONVERSION-DIAS(WS-CODIGO)
              GIVING WS-DIVISOR
              ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-MULTIPLY
      *
           DIVIDE TFC-DIAS-A-CONTAR BY WS-DIVISOR
              GIVING WS-NUM-PERIODOS
              ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-DIVIDE
      *
           ADD CTE-CON-1                      TO WS-NUM-PERIODOS
             ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-ADD.
