              END-IF
              MOVE W075-NUMDIAS           TO WS-DIAS
           ELSE
              MOVE WS-FECHA-LIQ          TO    AUX-AAAA-MM-DD
              MOVE AUX-AAAA              TO    WS-AUX-AAAA
