      *             28331112-CALCULAR-INT                              *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE CALCULA LOS INTERESES                                     *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       28331112-CALCULAR-INT.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------
      *          SE USA  LA AMORTIZACION: WS-CAPITAL-1
      *          PARA RESTAR DEL SALDO DEL CAPITAL CUANDO
      *          SE TRATA DE CALCULAR LOS "INTERESES ADELANTADOS"

      **---------------------------------------------------------------*
      *-----------------------------------------------------------
      *         INICIALIZAMOS Y MOVEMOS LAS VARIABLES UTILIZADAS EN EL
      *         CALCULO DE INTERESES AL COPY DE LA RUTINA UR8CFIN0
      *
           INITIALIZE URWCFIN
      *SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES UTILIZANDO UNICAMENTE EL TIPO
      *DE TASA NOMINAL

           MOVE WS-TASA-NOMINAL     TO FIN-TIPINT
           MOVE 'N'                 TO FIN-TIPOTASA

           MOVE '1001'              TO FIN-PERCAPIT
           MOVE WS-PERINT           TO FIN-PERINT
           MOVE ADS-DIASCAL         TO FIN-DIASCAL
           MOVE WS-CAPITAL          TO FIN-CAPITAL
           IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING OR SW-SI-SUB-COBLH
              AND WS-VR-OPCOMP > 0
              COMPUTE FIN-CAPITAL = FIN-CAPITAL + WS-VR-OPCOMP
           END-IF

           MOVE WS-DIAS             TO FIN-PERIODO-NUM
           IF WS-DIAS < 1000
              MOVE CTE-ALFA-1           TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
           ELSE
              IF WS-DIAS > 999 AND < 2000
                 MOVE CTE-ALFA-6        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
              END-IF
              IF WS-DIAS > 1999 AND < 3000
                 MOVE CTE-ALFA-7        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
              END-IF
              IF WS-DIAS > 2999 AND < 4000
                 MOVE CTE-ALFA-8        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
              END-IF
           END-IF

              IF FIN-TIPINT > 0
                PERFORM 283311120-RUT-DAT-PAG-ANT
              END-IF

      *-----------------------------------------------------------

           MOVE ADS-CODTIPRE      TO FIN-CDRETORNO
           MOVE ADS-CODTIAMO      TO FIN-MODULRES
           MOVE COF1-FECBUS(1:4)  TO FIN-MODULRES(2:4)
           CALL BBVA-UR8CFIN0
                           USING URWCFIN

           PERFORM 2217211121-EVALUAR-COD-RET

           COMPUTE  WS-INTERES-AUX ROUNDED = FIN-INTERES
      *
      *    SI EL TIPODIAS ES 3 SE CALCULAN EL AJUSTE DE INTERESES
      *    A COBRAR EN EL PRIMER RECIBO.
      *
           IF ADS-TIPODIAS   = CTE-CON-3
      *-----------------------------------------------------------
      *         CALCULO DE INTERESES AL COPY DE LA RUTINA UR8CFIN0
      *   YA QUE EL CRONOGRAMA SE ESTA CALCULADO  EN FORMA EXACTA
      *   WS-AJUSTE-DIAS SIEMPRE ES CERO
           MOVE ZERO                TO WS-AJUSTE-DIAS
      *
           INITIALIZE URWCFIN
      *SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES UTILIZANDO UNICAMENTE EL TIPO
      *DE TASA NOMINAL

              MOVE WS-TASA-NOMINAL  TO FIN-TIPINT
              MOVE 'N'              TO FIN-TIPOTASA

               MOVE '1001'              TO FIN-PERCAPIT
               MOVE WS-PERINT           TO FIN-PERINT
               MOVE ADS-DIASCAL         TO FIN-DIASCAL
               MOVE WS-CAPITAL          TO FIN-CAPITAL
           IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING OR SW-SI-SUB-COBLH
              AND WS-VR-OPCOMP > 0
                 COMPUTE FIN-CAPITAL = FIN-CAPITAL + WS-VR-OPCOMP
              END-IF
               MOVE WS-AJUSTE-DIAS      TO FIN-PERIODO-NUM
               IF WS-AJUSTE-DIAS < 1000
                  MOVE CTE-ALFA-1           TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
               ELSE
                  IF WS-AJUSTE-DIAS > 999 AND < 2000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-6        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
                  IF WS-AJUSTE-DIAS > 1999 AND < 3000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-7        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
                  IF WS-AJUSTE-DIAS > 2999 AND < 4000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-8        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
               END-IF
      *-----------------------------------------------------------

               IF FIN-TIPINT > 0
                  PERFORM 283311120-RUT-DAT-PAG-ANT
               END-IF

               CALL BBVA-UR8CFIN0
                               USING URWCFIN

               PERFORM 2217211121-EVALUAR-COD-RET

               COMPUTE WS-INTERES-AJUSTE ROUNDED = FIN-INTERES
      *
           END-IF

           SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-AJUSTE FROM WS-INTERES-AUX
              GIVING WS-INTERES-CUOTA
              ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-SUBTRACT
      *================================================================*
      *    MODIFICACIO PER A CALCULAR PER DIES NATURALS ELS INTERES-  *
      *    SOS QUAN HI HA FRACCIO.                                    *
      *================================================================*

           IF WS-INTERES-AJUSTE NOT = 0 AND
              ADS-DIASCAL = CTE-CON-COMERCIALES
              MOVE CTE-CON-NATURALES   TO ADS-DIASCAL
              PERFORM 28331111-CALCULAR-DIAS
              MOVE WS-DIAS             TO FIN-PERIODO-NUM
              MOVE CTE-CON-COMERCIALES TO ADS-DIASCAL
      *-----------------------------------------------------------
      *         INICIALIZAMOS Y MOVEMOS LAS VARIABLES UTILIZADAS EN EL
      *         CALCULO DE INTERESES AL COPY DE LA RUTINA UR8CFIN0
      *
           INITIALIZE URWCFIN
      *-----------------------------------------------------------

      *SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES UTILIZANDO UNICAMENTE EL TIPO
      *DE TASA NOMINAL

              MOVE WS-TASA-NOMINAL  TO FIN-TIPINT
              MOVE 'N'              TO FIN-TIPOTASA

               MOVE '1001'              TO FIN-PERCAPIT
               MOVE WS-PERINT           TO FIN-PERINT
               MOVE ADS-DIASCAL         TO FIN-DIASCAL
               MOVE WS-CAPITAL          TO FIN-CAPITAL
           IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING OR SW-SI-SUB-COBLH
              AND WS-VR-OPCOMP > 0
                 COMPUTE FIN-CAPITAL = FIN-CAPITAL + WS-VR-OPCOMP
              END-IF

               IF WS-DIAS < 1000
                  MOVE CTE-ALFA-1           TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
               ELSE
                  IF WS-DIAS > 999 AND < 2000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-6        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
                  IF WS-DIAS > 1999 AND < 3000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-7        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
                  IF WS-DIAS > 2999 AND < 4000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-8        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
               END-IF
      *-----------------------------------------------------------

               IF FIN-TIPINT > 0
                  PERFORM 283311120-RUT-DAT-PAG-ANT
               END-IF

      *     JLG CAMBIO CALL ESTATICO POR DINAMICO
      *        CALL 'UR8CFIN0' USING URWCFIN
               CALL BBVA-UR8CFIN0
                               USING URWCFIN
               PERFORM 2217211121-EVALUAR-COD-RET

               COMPUTE WS-INTERES-AUX    ROUNDED = FIN-INTERES
           END-IF.

           IF WS-INTERES-AJUSTE NOT = 0 AND
              ADS-DIASCAL = CTE-CON-MIXTOS
              MOVE CTE-CON-NATURALES   TO ADS-DIASCAL
              PERFORM 28331111-CALCULAR-DIAS
              MOVE WS-DIAS             TO FIN-PERIODO-NUM
              MOVE CTE-CON-MIXTOS      TO ADS-DIASCAL
      *-----------------------------------------------------------
      *     JLG INICIALIZAMOS Y MOVEMOS LAS VARIABLES UTILIZADAS EN EL
      *         CALCULO DE INTERESES AL COPY DE LA RUTINA UR8CFIN0
      *
           INITIALIZE URWCFIN
      *SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES UTILIZANDO UNICAMENTE EL TIPO
      *DE TASA NOMINAL

              MOVE WS-TASA-NOMINAL  TO FIN-TIPINT
              MOVE 'N'              TO FIN-TIPOTASA

               MOVE '1001'              TO FIN-PERCAPIT
               MOVE WS-PERINT           TO FIN-PERINT
               MOVE ADS-DIASCAL         TO FIN-DIASCAL
               MOVE WS-CAPITAL          TO FIN-CAPITAL
           IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING OR SW-SI-SUB-COBLH
              AND WS-VR-OPCOMP > 0
                 COMPUTE FIN-CAPITAL = FIN-CAPITAL + WS-VR-OPCOMP
              END-IF

               IF WS-DIAS < 1000
                  MOVE CTE-ALFA-1           TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
               ELSE
                  IF WS-DIAS > 999 AND < 2000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-6        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
                  IF WS-DIAS > 1999 AND < 3000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-7        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
                  IF WS-DIAS > 2999 AND < 4000
                     MOVE CTE-ALFA-8        TO FIN-PERIODO-TIP
                  END-IF
               END-IF
      *-----------------------------------------------------------

               IF FIN-TIPINT > 0
                  PERFORM 283311120-RUT-DAT-PAG-ANT
               END-IF

               CALL BBVA-UR8CFIN0
                               USING URWCFIN

               PERFORM 2217211121-EVALUAR-COD-RET

               COMPUTE WS-INTERES-AUX    ROUNDED = FIN-INTERES
           END-IF

      *================================================================*
      *
           IF WS-TIPO-CUOTA EQUAL CTE-CON-REGLA-78
              PERFORM  28331113-CALC-INTERES-REGLA78
           END-IF.
           MOVE WS-INTERES-AUX TO WS-INTERES-CUOTA

           ADD WS-INTERES-AUX TO WS-INTERES-ACUM
              GIVING WS-INTERES-TOTAL
              ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-ADD

           MOVE ZERO TO WS-AJUSTE-DIAS.

           IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING  OR SW-SI-SUB-COBLH
              COMPUTE WS-INT-LEASING = WS-INTERES-CUOTA
           END-IF

      * CONTROLA QUE EL INTERES CALCULADO NO SEA MAYOR QUE LA CUOTA
      * ( SE DA EN CASOS DE ASIGNAR CUOTAS ADICIONALES A MAS DE 4
      * 4 PERIODOS POR ANYO)
           PERFORM 221721112-1-CONTROLA-INT.

      *
      *================================================================*
      *     LLAMA A RUTINA QUE CONSULTA EL TIPO DE CARTERA Y TAE       *
      *================================================================*
       283311120-RUT-DAT-PAG-ANT.
      *
      *@COL01-I
      *    MOVE '283311120-RUT-DAT-PA'     TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
      *    MOVE 'RESTO 4             '     TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
      *    MOVE SPACES                     TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *    PERFORM 998-ESCRIBIR-CNTRACE
      *@COL01-F
      *
           INITIALIZE UGTCT37

           MOVE '1901'                       TO T37-SECCION
           MOVE TBLA-PROSUB                  TO T37-ELEMENTO(1:4)
                                                LQS-SUBPRO(1:4)

      *    MOVE TBLA-FESOLIC                 TO WS-DATE-SCREEN
           PERFORM  9999921-FORMT-FECHA-DB2
           MOVE WS-DATE-DB2                  TO LQS-FECOVALI
           MOVE '101'                        TO LQS-CODCONLI
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT RESTO
                 INTO :T37-RESTO
                 FROM UGDTT37
                WHERE SECCION    = :T37-SECCION
                  AND ELEMENTO   = :T37-ELEMENTO
           END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                       TO DB2-RETURN-CDE

           IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
              MOVE T37-RESTO(1:1)             TO WS-TIPO-CAR
           ELSE
              IF DB2-NOTFND AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
                 CONTINUE
              ELSE
                 MOVE 'UGE0939'               TO TBLA-CODERROR
                 MOVE '30'                    TO TBLA-CODRETO
                 MOVE 'UGDTT37 SQLCODE '      TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
                 MOVE DB2-RETURN-CDE          TO TBLA-DESCRIP2
                 PERFORM 30000-FINAL
              END-IF
           END-IF

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT  TIPOAPLI
                INTO :LQS-TIPOAPLI
                FROM  UGDTLQS
              WHERE  SUBPRO        = :LQS-SUBPRO
                AND   CODCONLI     = :LQS-CODCONLI
                AND   FECOVALI    <= :LQS-FECOVALI
                AND   FEFIVALI    >= :LQS-FECOVALI
           END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                       TO DB2-RETURN-CDE

           IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
              MOVE LQS-TIPOAPLI               TO WS-EFECTIVA
           ELSE
              IF DB2-NOTFND AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
                 MOVE FIN-TIPINT              TO WS-EFECTIVA
      *COL11-I
                 IF SW-CREDITOVIRTUAL-SI
                    PERFORM VALIDA-TIPO-TASA
                    MOVE WS-EFECTIVA-CV       TO WS-EFECTIVA
                 END-IF
      *COL11-F
              ELSE
                 MOVE 'UGDTLQS'               TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
                 PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
              END-IF
           END-IF

           IF WS-TIPO-CAR = 'H'
              IF TBLA-TIPOINT <= ZEROS AND TBLA-TAE <= ZEROS
                 MOVE WS-TIPO-CAR          TO FIN-TIPO-CARTERA
                 MOVE WS-EFECTIVA          TO FIN-TIPINT
              ELSE
                 MOVE WS-TIPO-CAR          TO FIN-TIPO-CARTERA
                 MOVE WS-TASA-EFECTIVA-F   TO FIN-TIPINT
              END-IF
           END-IF.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             28331113-CALC-INTERES-REGLA78.                     *
      *                                                                *
      *  SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES DE LA CUOTA BAJO REGLA 78.          *
      *                       X                                        *
      *                I = -------- * (I.TOTALES)                      *
      *                    Y(Y+1)/2                                    *
      *  X= NUMERO DE PAGOS PENDIENTES = WS-UGNPLPEN                   *
      *  Y= NUMERO DE PAGOS TOTALES DEL PRESTAMO=WS-UGNPLINI           *
      *================================================================*
       28331113-CALC-INTERES-REGLA78.

           ADD 1 TO WS-UGNPLINI
              GIVING WS-UGNPLINI-1
              ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-ADD

           MULTIPLY WS-UGNPLINI-1 BY WS-UGNPLINI
               GIVING WS-UGNPLINI-2
               ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-MULTIPLY

           DIVIDE WS-UGNPLINI-2 BY 2
                GIVING WS-DENOMINADOR
                ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-DIVIDE

           DIVIDE WS-UGNPLPEN BY WS-DENOMINADOR
                GIVING WS-INTERES-R78
                ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-DIVIDE

           MULTIPLY WS-INTERES-R78 BY WS-INTINITO
               GIVING WS-INTERES-AUX
               ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-MULTIPLY

      * SE RESTA 1 AL NUMERO DE PERIODOS PENDIENTES PARA LA SIGUIENTE
      * LINEA DEL CUADRO

           SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-UGNPLPEN
              GIVING WS-UGNPLPEN
              ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-SUBTRACT.
      *

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             28331113-ANAL-INDSUBVE                            *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE ANALIZA EL INDICADOR DE SUBVENCION LLAMANDO A LAS         *
      *   RUTINAS ENCARGADAS DE EFECTUAR LOS CALCULOS PARA CADA        *
      *   TIPO                                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*

       28331113-ANAL-INDSUBVE.

           INITIALIZE WS-RECIBO-1
           IF ADS-INDSUBVE   = CTE-CON-LI OR
              ADS-INDSUBVE   = 'N'
              MOVE ZERO                         TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
              MOVE WS-INTERES-TOTAL             TO WS-INTERES-1

              IF WS-CUOTA-CAPITAL
                 MOVE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL          TO WS-CAPITAL-1
              ELSE
                 SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
                    GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
                    ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                 END-SUBTRACT
              END-IF
           ELSE
               CONTINUE
           END-IF
              SUBTRACT WS-CAPITAL-1 FROM WS-SALDO-VIVO
                 GIVING WS-SALDO-1
                 ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
              END-SUBTRACT
           ADD WS-CAPITAL-1 TO WS-INTERES-1
              GIVING WS-RECIBO-1
              ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-ADD.


           IF  WS-PERIODOS >  WS-LIMITE
               ADD WS-GASTOS-1X TO WS-RECIBO-1
                   GIVING WS-RECIBO-1
                   ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-ADD
           ELSE
               ADD WS-GASTOS-1 TO WS-RECIBO-1
                   GIVING WS-RECIBO-1
                   ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-ADD
           END-IF.
      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             283311131-TIPOSUB-1                               *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE REALIZAN LOS CALCULOS PARA EL TIPOSUB 1 (TANTO POR CIENTO *
      *   DE SUBVENCION SOBRE LOS INTERESES)                           *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*

       283311131-TIPOSUB-1.


      **   SE OBTIENE EL PORCENTAJE DE SUBVENCION PARA EL TRAMO
      *    EN EL QUE NOS ENCONTRAMOS.

           PERFORM  2833111311-ACCEDER-UTRA-PORC

      *    SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES SUBVENCIONADOS

           IF DB2-NOTFND AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
              MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
              MOVE WS-INTERES-TOTAL    TO WS-INTERES-1
           ELSE
              IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
                 CONTINUE
                 MULTIPLY WS-INTERES-TOTAL BY WS-COMP-2
                    GIVING WS-COMP-2
                    ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                 END-MULTIPLY
                 DIVIDE WS-COMP-2 BY WS-INTERES-NOMINAL
                    GIVING WS-COMP-2
                    ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                 END-DIVIDE
                 MOVE WS-COMP-2 TO WS-INTERES-1

                 SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-1 FROM WS-INTERES-TOTAL
                    GIVING WS-SUBVENCION-1
                    ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                  END-SUBTRACT
              ELSE
                 MOVE 'UGDTTRA'            TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
                 PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
              END-IF
           END-IF
           IF WS-CUOTA-CAPITAL
              MOVE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL           TO WS-CAPITAL-1
           ELSE
              SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
                 GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
                 ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
              END-SUBTRACT
           END-IF.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             283311131-TIPOSUB-32                              *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE REALIZAN LOS CALCULOS PARA EL TIPOSUB 32(TANTO POR CIENTO *
      *   DE SUBVENCION SOBRE LOS INTERESES) CUANDO ES EN CARENCIA     *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*

       283311131-TIPOSUB-32.


      *    SE OBTIENE EL PORCENTAJE DE SUBVENCION PARA EL TRAMO
      *    EN EL QUE NOS ENCONTRAMOS.

           PERFORM  2833111311-ACCEDER-UTRA-PORC

      *    SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES SUBVENCIONADOS

           IF DB2-NOTFND AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
              MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
              MOVE WS-INTERES-TOTAL    TO WS-INTERES-1
           ELSE
              IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
                 DIVIDE WS-COMP-2 BY WS-INTERES-NOMINAL
                    GIVING WS-COMP-2
                    ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                 END-DIVIDE
                 MOVE WS-COMP-2 TO WS-INTERES-1

                 SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-1 FROM WS-INTERES-TOTAL
                    GIVING WS-SUBVENCION-1
                    ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                  END-SUBTRACT
              ELSE
                 MOVE 'UGDTTRA'            TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
                 PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
              END-IF
           END-IF
           IF WS-CUOTA-CAPITAL
              MOVE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL           TO WS-CAPITAL-1
           ELSE
              SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
                 GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
                 ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
              END-SUBTRACT
           END-IF.
      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             2833111311-ACCEDER-UTRA-PORC                       *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE ACCEDE A LA TABLA DE TRAMOS DE SUBVENCIONES PARA OBTENER  *
      *   EL PORCENTAJE DE SUBVENCION QUE SE USARA EN EL TRAMO         *
      *   SELECCIONADO.                                                *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*

       2833111311-ACCEDER-UTRA-PORC.
           MOVE SQLCODE       TO DB2-RETURN-CDE.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             283311132-TIPOSUB-2                                *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE REALIZAN LOS CALCULOS PARA EL TIPOSUB 2 (DIFERENCIA DE    *
      *   CUADROS)                                                     *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       283311132-TIPOSUB-2.
      *
           IF WS-LININIVA      NOT > WS-CONT-AMO AND
              WS-LINFINVA      NOT < WS-CONT-AMO
               DIVIDE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL    BY WS-PORC-SUBVEN
                 GIVING WS-COMP-2
                 ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-DIVIDE
               MOVE WS-COMP-2              TO WS-CUOTA-NUEVA
               SUBTRACT WS-CUOTA-NUEVA    FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
                 GIVING WS-SUBVENCION-1
                 ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-SUBTRACT
           ELSE
               MOVE ZERO                   TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
           END-IF

           SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
             GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
             ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-SUBTRACT
           MOVE WS-INTERES-TOTAL           TO WS-INTERES-1.

           IF WS-SUBVENCION-1 NOT > WS-INTERES-CUOTA
               SUBTRACT WS-SUBVENCION-1 FROM WS-INTERES-CUOTA
                   GIVING WS-INTERES-1
               ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-SUBTRACT
               MOVE ZERO TO WS-CAPITAL-NUEVO
           ELSE
               MOVE ZERO TO WS-INTERES-1
               MOVE WS-CAPITAL-1 TO WS-CAPITAL-NUEVO
               SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-SUBVENCION-1
                   GIVING WS-COMP-2
               ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-SUBTRACT
               SUBTRACT WS-COMP-2 FROM WS-CAPITAL-1
                   GIVING WS-COMP-2
               ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-SUBTRACT
               MOVE WS-COMP-2 TO WS-CAPITAL-1
           END-IF.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *                  283311132-TIPOSUB-12-22                       *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE REALIZAN LOS CALCULOS PARA EL TIPOSUB 12 Y EL 22.         *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       283311132-TIPOSUB-12-22.
      *
           IF WS-LININIVA       NOT > WS-CONT-AMO AND
              WS-LINFINVA       NOT < WS-CONT-AMO
               PERFORM  22172111321-CALC-CUOTA-SUBV
           ELSE
               MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
           END-IF

           DIVIDE WS-INTERES-CUOTA BY WS-INTERES-NOMINAL
              GIVING WS-COMP-2
             ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-DIVIDE
           MULTIPLY WS-COMP-2      BY WS-TIPOINT-TITULAR
              GIVING WS-INTERES-1
             ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-MULTIPLY
           SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-1     FROM WS-CUOTA-NUEVA
             GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
             ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-SUBTRACT.


      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             22172111321-CALC-CUOTA-SUBV                        *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE CALCULA LA CUOTA REAL.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       22172111321-CALC-CUOTA-SUBV.
      *
           DIVIDE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL    BY WS-PORC-SUBVEN
             GIVING WS-COMP-2
             ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-DIVIDE
           MOVE WS-COMP-2 TO WS-CUOTA-NUEVA
           SUBTRACT WS-CUOTA-NUEVA  FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
             GIVING WS-SUBVENCION-1
             ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-SUBTRACT.


      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             283311133-TIPOSUB-6                                *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE REALIZAN LOS CALCULOS PARA EL TIPOSUB 6 (SUBVENCION       *
      *   SOBRE EL CAPITAL)                                            *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*

       283311133-TIPOSUB-6.

           PERFORM  2833111311-ACCEDER-UTRA-PORC
           IF DB2-NOTFND AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
               MOVE ZERO                  TO WS-SUBVENCION-1

               IF WS-CUOTA-CAPITAL
                   MOVE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL    TO WS-CAPITAL-1
               ELSE
                   SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
                     GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
                     ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                   END-SUBTRACT
               END-IF
               MOVE WS-CAPITAL-1 TO WS-CAPITAL-NUEVO
           ELSE
               IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
                   PERFORM  2833111331-PARTE-CAPITAL
               ELSE
                   MOVE 'UGDTTRA'            TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
                   PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
               END-IF
           END-IF
           MOVE WS-INTERES-TOTAL           TO  WS-INTERES-1.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             2833111331-PARTE-CAPITAL                           *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE CALCULA LA PARTE DE CAPITAL SUBVENCIONADO.                *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*

       2833111331-PARTE-CAPITAL.

           IF WS-CUOTA-CAPITAL
               MOVE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL           TO WS-CAPITAL-NUEVO
           ELSE
               SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
                  GIVING WS-CAPITAL-NUEVO
                  ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
               END-SUBTRACT
           END-IF
           DIVIDE WS-CAPITAL-NUEVO BY CTE-CON-100-COMP3
             GIVING WS-COMP-2
             ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-DIVIDE
           MOVE WS-COMP-2                     TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
           SUBTRACT WS-SUBVENCION-1 FROM WS-CAPITAL-NUEVO
             GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
             ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-SUBTRACT.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *                     283311133-TIPOSUB-8                        *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE REALIZAN LOS CALCULOS PARA EL TIPOSUB 8 (TANTO POR CIENTO *
      *   DE SUBVENCION SOBRE CAPITAL E INTERESES)                     *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*

       283311133-TIPOSUB-8.


      *    SE OBTIENE EL PORCENTAJE DE SUBVENCION PARA EL TRAMO
      *    EN EL QUE NOS ENCONTRAMOS.

           PERFORM  2833111311-ACCEDER-UTRA-PORC

      *    SE CALCULAN LOS INTERESES SUBVENCIONADOS

           IF DB2-NOTFND AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
               MOVE ZERO                 TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
               MOVE WS-INTERES-TOTAL     TO WS-INTERES-1
               IF WS-CUOTA-CAPITAL
                   MOVE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL   TO WS-CAPITAL-1
               ELSE
                   SUBTRACT WS-INTERES-CUOTA FROM WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL
                     GIVING WS-CAPITAL-1
                     ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                   END-SUBTRACT
               END-IF
               MOVE WS-CAPITAL           TO WS-INTERES-NUEVO
           ELSE
               IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES
                   PERFORM  2833111331-PARTE-CAPITAL
                   DIVIDE WS-COMP-2 BY CTE-CON-100-COMP3
                      GIVING WS-COMP-2
                      ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                   END-DIVIDE
                   SUBTRACT WS-COMP-2 FROM WS-INTERES-TOTAL
                      GIVING WS-INTERES-1
                      ON SIZE ERROR  PERFORM  21711-REBOSAMIENTO
                   END-SUBTRACT
                   ADD WS-COMP-2 TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
                      GIVING WS-SUBVENCION-1
               ELSE
                   PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
               END-IF
           END-IF.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             2833112-LINEAS-SIG-AL                             *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE CALCULAN LAS LINEAS SIGUIENTES EN EL CASO DE QUE SE       *
      *   AMORTICE Y LIQUIDE A LA VEZ.                                 *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       2833112-LINEAS-SIG-AL.
      *
           IF WS-TIPO-CUOTA = 'B'
                ADD CTE-CON-1                    TO WS-REBS
                IF WS-REBS > COT-AMO-ANNO
                    MOVE WS-SALDO-VIVO           TO WS-CAPITAL
                                                    WS-CAPITAL-INICIAL
                ELSE
                    MOVE WS-CAPITAL-INICIAL      TO WS-CAPITAL
                END-IF
           ELSE
                MOVE WS-SALDO-VIVO               TO WS-CAPITAL
           END-IF

           MOVE WS-INTERES-NOMINAL              TO WS-INTERES

           PERFORM  28331121-CALCULAR-DIAS-SIG

           PERFORM  28331112-CALCULAR-INT

      *
      *    SE EFECTUAN LOS CALCULOS EN EL CASO DE QUE ESTEMOS
      *    EN LA ULTIMA LINEA DEL CUADRO
      *
           IF WS-NUM-PERIODOS = WS-CONT-AMO
               PERFORM  28331122-ANAL-SUB-ULT
           ELSE
               PERFORM  28331123-CONTI-CUADRO
           END-IF.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             28331121-CALCULAR-DIAS-SIG                        *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE CALCULAN LOS DIAS EN EL CASO DE QUE SE AMORTIZE Y LIQUIDE *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       28331121-CALCULAR-DIAS-SIG.
      *
           IF WS-FECHA-LIQ-ANT = WS-FECHA-AMO-ANT OR
              WS-FECHA-LIQ-ANT > WS-FECHA-AMO-ANT
      *
      *    SE CALCULAN LOS DIAS COMO DIFERENCIA ENTRE FECHA
      *    DE LIQUIDACION ACTUAL Y FECHA DE LIQUIDACION ANTERIOR
      *
              PERFORM  28331111-CALCULAR-DIAS
           ELSE
      *
      *    SE CALCULAN LOS DIAS ENTRE LA FECHA DE LIQUIDACION
      *    ACTUAL Y LA FECHA DE AMORTIZACION ANTERIOR
      *
               IF ADS-DIASCAL    = CTE-CON-COMERCIALES
                               OR  CTE-CON-PERDIDA

                   MOVE CTE-CON-3              TO    W075-CDOPCIO
                   MOVE ZERO                   TO    W075-NUMDIAS
                   MOVE CTE-CON-CO             TO    W075-TPTRAT
      *
                   MOVE WS-FECHA-AMO-ANT       TO    AUX-AAAA-MM-DD
                   MOVE AUX-AAAA               TO    WS-AUX-AAAA
                   MOVE AUX-MM                 TO    WS-AUX-MM
                   MOVE AUX-DD                 TO    WS-AUX-DD
                   MOVE WS-AUX-DD-MM-AAAA      TO    W075-FHGRE1
      *
                   MOVE WS-FECHA-LIQ           TO    AUX-AAAA-MM-DD
                   MOVE AUX-AAAA               TO    WS-AUX-AAAA
                   MOVE AUX-MM                 TO    WS-AUX-MM
                   MOVE AUX-DD                 TO    WS-AUX-DD
                   MOVE WS-AUX-DD-MM-AAAA      TO    W075-FHGRE2

                   EXEC CICS LINK
                       PROGRAM ('TC1C1220')
                       COMMAREA (TCWC0750-AREA)
                   END-EXEC

                   IF W075-CDRETORN NOT = CTE-CON-ALFA-00
                 MOVE 'TC1C1220'             TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
                 MOVE 'UGE1141'              TO TBLA-CODERROR
                 MOVE '30'                    TO TBLA-CODRETO
                      PERFORM 30000-FINAL
                   END-IF
                   MOVE W075-NUMDIAS           TO WS-DIAS
               ELSE
                   MOVE WS-FECHA-LIQ          TO    AUX-AAAA-MM-DD
                   MOVE AUX-AAAA              TO    WS-AUX-AAAA
                   MOVE AUX-MM                TO    WS-AUX-MM
                   MOVE AUX-DD                TO    WS-AUX-DD
                   MOVE WS-AUX-DD-MM-AAAA     TO    W075-FHGRE2

                   MOVE WS-FECHA-AMO-ANT          TO    AUX-AAAA-MM-DD
                   MOVE AUX-AAAA                  TO    WS-AUX-AAAA
                   MOVE AUX-MM                    TO    WS-AUX-MM
                   MOVE AUX-DD                    TO    WS-AUX-DD
                   MOVE WS-AUX-DD-MM-AAAA         TO    W075-FHGRE1
      *
                   MOVE CTE-CON-3                 TO    W075-CDOPCIO
      *@        PARA ADS-DIASCAL: N  O  X   Y PARA CALCULO DE
      *@        DIAS SE UTILIZA DIAS DE 365 AL A┬ªO
                   MOVE CTE-CON-NA                TO    W075-TPTRAT
      *
                   EXEC CICS LINK
                        PROGRAM ('TC1C1220')
                        COMMAREA (TCWC0750-AREA)
                   END-EXEC

                   IF W075-CDRETORN NOT = CTE-CON-ALFA-00
                      MOVE 'TC1C1220'             TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
                      MOVE 'UGE1141'              TO TBLA-CODERROR
                      MOVE '30'                    TO TBLA-CODRETO
                      PERFORM 30000-FINAL
                   END-IF

                  MOVE W075-NUMDIAS                TO WS-DIAS
               END-IF
           END-IF.

      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             28331122-ANAL-SUB-ULT                             *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE EFECTUAN LOS CALCULOS DE LA ULTIMA LINEA DEL CUADRO DE    *
      *   AMORTIZACION                                                 *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       28331122-ANAL-SUB-ULT.

      *@  SE ZEREA EL VALOR DEL WS-INTERES-TOTAL  CUANDO EL INTERES
      *@  DEL TIPO ADELANTADO

      **---------------------------------------------------------------*
           IF ADS-INDSUBVE   = CTE-CON-LI  OR
              ADS-INDSUBVE   = 'N'
      *
      *    EL PRESTAMO NO ESTA SUBVENCIONADO
      *
               MOVE ZERO                      TO WS-SUBVENCION-1
               MOVE WS-SALDO-VIVO             TO WS-CAPITAL-1
      *
      * MODIFICACION REALIZADA PARA CONSEGUIR QUE LA ULTIMA CUOTA SEA
      * EXACTAMENTE IGUAL QUE LAS ANTERIORES. LA DIFERENCIA POR REDON-
      * DEOS AFECTA AL CAMPO INTERESES DE LA CUOTA.
               MOVE ADS-CODTIAMO              TO CTE-CON-CODTIAMO
               IF ADS-CODTIAMO = 'L' OR 'M'
                  COMPUTE WS-DIFER = WS-CUOTA-FIN - WS-CAPITAL-1 -
                                     WS-INTERES-TOTAL
                  IF WS-DIFER < 5 AND WS-DIFER > -5
                     COMPUTE WS-INTERES-TOTAL = WS-INTERES-TOTAL +
                                                WS-DIFER
                  END-IF
               END-IF
               MOVE WS-INTERES-TOTAL          TO WS-INTERES-1
           ELSE
              CONTINUE
           SUBTRACT WS-CAPITAL-1 FROM WS-SALDO-VIVO
             GIVING WS-SALDO-1
                 ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-SUBTRACT
           END-IF
           ADD WS-CAPITAL-1 TO WS-INTERES-1
             GIVING WS-RECIBO-1
             ON SIZE ERROR PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
           END-ADD.
      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             28331123-CONTI-CUADRO                             *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE CALCULAN LAS LINEAS DEL CUADRO DE AMORTIZACION            *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       28331123-CONTI-CUADRO.
      *
           PERFORM  283311231-COPY-CUOTA

           MOVE CO2-CUOTA TO WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL

           PERFORM  28331113-ANAL-INDSUBVE.
           IF  ADS-CODTIAMO  = 'P' OR 'G'
               IF  WS-CO2-COEFICUA  > 0
                   COMPUTE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL ROUNDED = CO2-CUOTA
                                                  / WS-CO2-COEFICUA
               END-IF
           END-IF.
      *================================================================*
      *                                                                *
      *             283311231-COPY-CUOTA                              *
      *                                                                *
      *   SE LLAMA A LA RUTINA DE CALCULO DE CUOTAS A PARTIR DE UNA    *
      *   DADA                                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *================================================================*
      *
       283311231-COPY-CUOTA.
      *   PARA EL CALCULO DE CUOTAS ESPECIALES
      *
           MOVE WS-FECHA-LIQ                TO WS-CO2-F-AMORTI
           MOVE WS-PERCAP                   TO WS-CO2-PERCAP
           MOVE ADS-TIPODIAS                TO WS-CO2-TIPODIAS
           MOVE ADS-UGCDIPAG                TO WS-CO2-UGCDIPAG
           IF  WS-CO2-UGCDIPAG = ZERO
               MOVE   WS-DATE-DB2-DIA       TO WS-CO2-UGCDIPAG
           END-IF
      *
      *   SE INFORMAN LOS CAMPOS DE LA RUTINA CON EL CODIGO DE TIPO
      *   DE AMORTIZACION, LA PRIMERA CUOTA, EL CAPITAL SOLICITADO,
      *   EL TIPO DE INTERES, LA RAZON DE PROGRESION Y LA
      *   SI SE DEBE PRODUCIR UN SALTO EN LA CUOTA
      *
           MOVE ADS-CODTIAMO                TO CO2-TIP-CUOTA
           MOVE WS-CUOTA-ACTUAL             TO CO2-CUOTA
           MOVE WS-SALDO-VIVO               TO CO2-SALDO
           MOVE SPACES                      TO CO2-COD-ERROR
                                               CO2-VAR1-ERROR
           IF ADS-DIASCAL    = CTE-CON-COMERCIALES
                                OR  CTE-CON-MIXTOS
               MOVE CTE-CON-360-COMP3       TO CO2-DIASCAL
           ELSE
               MOVE CTE-CON-365-COMP3       TO CO2-DIASCAL
           END-IF
           MOVE WS-RAZON                    TO CO2-RAZON
           IF WS-CONT-LIN > ADS-LININCUO
               MOVE CTE-CON-1               TO CO2-SALTO-CUOTA
               MOVE CTE-CON-1               TO WS-CONT-LIN
           ELSE
               MOVE ZERO                    TO CO2-SALTO-CUOTA
           END-IF

           IF ADS-CODTIAMO = 'B'
               IF WS-REBS > COT-AMO-ANNO
                   MOVE WS-SALDO-VIVO       TO CO2-CAPITAL-INICIAL
                                               WS-CAPITAL-INICIAL
                   MOVE CTE-CON-1           TO WS-REBS
               ELSE
                   MOVE WS-CAPITAL-INICIAL  TO CO2-CAPITAL-INICIAL
               END-IF
           END-IF
           IF ADS-CODTIAMO = 'H'
                 move COT-AMO-ANNO          to CO2-AMO-ANNO
                 MOVE   COT-INT-NOMINAL     TO CO2-INT-NOMINAL
                 COMPUTE WS-PER-REST =
                         (WS-NUM-PERIODOS - WS-CONT-AMO) + 1
                 MOVE   WS-PER-REST         TO CO2-PERIODOS-REST
           END-IF
      *EN EL CASO EN EL QUE EXISTA CARENCIA
           IF ADS-CODTIAMO = 'C'  AND
              ( WS-CARECAP NOT EQUAL SPACES) AND NO-CALCULADO

            MOVE SPACES               TO     CO2-PLAZO
            MOVE TBLA-PLAZO(2:3)      TO     WS-NUMERO-5
            MOVE WS-CARECAP(2:3)      TO     WS-NUMERO-6
            COMPUTE WS-PLAZO-NUM = WS-NUMERO-5 - WS-NUMERO-6
            MOVE '30'                TO      CO2-PLAZO(1:2)
            MOVE WS-PLAZO-NUM        TO      CO2-PLAZO(3:2)
            SET SI-CALCULADO         TO      TRUE
           END-IF

           PERFORM  RUTINA-CALC-CUOTA-SIGUIENTE
           IF CO2-COD-ERROR NOT = SPACES
               MOVE CO2-COD-ERROR           TO TBLA-CODERROR
               MOVE '30'                    TO TBLA-CODRETO
               MOVE CO2-VAR1-ERROR          TO TBLA-DESCRIP1
               PERFORM  30000-FINAL
           END-IF

           IF CO2-CODIGO = CTE-CON-99
               MOVE CTE-CON-UGE0298         TO TBLA-CODERROR
               MOVE '30'                    TO TBLA-CODRETO
               PERFORM  30000-FINAL
           END-IF.
           IF (COT-TIPO-CAR = 'H' AND COT-TIP-CUOTA = 'I') OR
               COT-TIP-CUOTA = 'K'
              IF WS-CO2-F-AMORTI(6:2) = '06' OR '12'
                 IF WS-CO2-F-AMORTI(1:7) = COT-F-FORMA(1:7)
                    COMPUTE CO2-CUOTA = CO2-CUOTA / 2
                    MOVE 'S'             TO WS-IND-GRACIA
                 ELSE
                    COMPUTE CO2-CUOTA = (CO2-CUOTA / 2) * COT-FACTOR-A
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 IF (WS-CO2-F-AMORTI(6:2) = '07' OR '01')
                    IF WS-IND-GRACIA = 'S'
                       COMPUTE CO2-CUOTA = CO2-CUOTA * 2
                       MOVE 'N'                TO WS-IND-GRACIA
                    ELSE
                      COMPUTE CO2-CUOTA = (CO2-CUOTA /
                                 COT-FACTOR-A) * 2
